<title>USA: South Lyon BA, Mich., won by First of America.</title>
<headline>South Lyon BA, Mich., won by First of America.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>First of America Securities Inc said it won $2.6550 million of South Lyon Building Authority, Mich., 1996 building authority lease rental revenue bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1401 percent.</p>
</text>
